{"title": "[花邊] Kerr盛讚Yaxel:他將會是比賽末段負責關門", "author": "pneumo (超☆冒險蓋)", "board": "", "date": "Tue Oct 27 13:26:43 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1793078806.A.9E5.html", "body": "來源：ESPN記者Anthony Slater\n網址：\nhttps://x.com/anthonyVslater/status/2114944618177650843\n\nSteve Kerr on Yaxel Lendeborg’s 31-12-6 in Denver\n\nKerr講到Yaxel今晚31-12-6的表現：\n\n“In all the critical spots, we put the ball in his hands. For a rookie to\nbe that advanced already is extremely rare.”\n\n「在所有的關鍵時刻，我們把球交給他。一個菜鳥有著卓越的球技是很少見的。」\n\n“He’s going to be a guy who closes games.”\n\n「他將會是在比賽末段負責關門的球員。」\n\n影片\n：\nhttps://streamable.com/h0lokm\n\n逐字稿\n\n\"He's strong as an ox and skilled, and the way the game is played, he's gonna\nbe able to get to the line a ton. And you saw it tonight, basically in all\nthe critical moments of the game, we just put the ball in his hands. And for\na rookie to be that advanced already, it's extremely rare. But it's exciting\nbecause I think he's gonna get a lot better.'\n\n「他壯的像頭牛，而且又非常有技巧，而從他打球的方式來看，他會非常頻繁的站上罰\n\n球線。」\n\n「就從今天晚上的比賽來看，基本上在所有的關鍵時刻，我們就把球交給他。」\n\n「一個菜鳥有著卓越的球技是很少見的。而且更令人興奮的是，我認為他還會變得更\n\n好。」\n\nReporter: \"How important is him getting to the line? I mean, you talked about\nit so much when Jimmy got here, that transforming the team, how important is\nthat?\n\n記者：「站上罰球線有多重要？我的意思是，當吉巴來勇士的時候，你就很常講這件事，\n\n說那會轉變球隊。那到底有多重要？」\n\n\"Changes everything. When you get to the line consistently, you can control\nthe game. The other team goes on a run, you go to a guy like Yaks or Jimmy,\nyou get fouled, the game slows down. You set your defense, the game just gets\na lot easier. And so Yaks having that ability combined with his passing\nskills, he's gonna be a guy who's gonna close games like he did tonight\"\n\n「那改變了一切！當你可以穩定的站上罰球線，你就控制了比賽。當其他隊伍打出了一\n\n波的時候，你就會需要像是Yaxel或者吉巴這樣的球員，拿到犯規，把節奏慢下來，開始\n\n佈防，這樣比賽就會變得簡單的多。」\n\n「所以Yaxel具備這樣的能力，加上他的傳球技巧，就像今晚，他會是比賽末段負責關門\n\n的球員。」\n\n----\n\n那個____我們不要了", "comments": [{"tag": "→", "user": "ZIDENS", "content": "白舔好幾年", 